WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.900
Mara: Wait. Was that you knocking on the tree?

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.100
Ranger: No. I heard an answer from the old tower.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.700
Mara: Three knocks, a pause, then two. That’s my brother’s signal.

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.600
Ranger: Then we go together. There’s another path beyond the barrier.
